      "widgets_values": [
        "■ 工作流: FLUX dev 全屏背景生成\n   用于 08-backgrounds.md 中的场景背景\n\n■ FLUX 优势:\n   - 提示词遵循度极高,支持长自然语言\n   - 中文理解优于 SDXL\n   - 出图质量更接近概念艺术\n\n■ Apple M4 Pro 单张预期:\n   1920x1088 / 25 步 -> 约 4-7 分钟\n   (FLUX 在 Apple Silicon 较慢但稳定)\n\n■ 提速选项:\n   - 改用 flux1-schnell.safetensors\n   - 步数降至 4\n   - 单张约 1 分钟\n   - 质量略降但适合批量\n\n■ 背景批次提示词模板替换:\n   bg_loading: misty mountains, small pavilion, falling bamboo leaves...\n   bg_sect_hall: grand cultivation sect main hall, eight trigrams floor pattern...\n   bg_battle_plains: open plains with distant mountains, scattered trees...\n   bg_boss_xuesha: blood-red demonic cavern, floating skeletons, magic circles...\n\n■ 配套清单: assets/specs/ui/08-backgrounds.md\n   每条提示词已写好,只需翻译关键部分"
